{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24203","headline":"菩提寺上方晚眺 · 白居易","name":"菩提寺上方晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼阁高低树浅深，山光水色暝沈沈。\n嵩烟半卷青绡幕，伊浪平铺绿绮衾。\n飞鸟灭时宜极目，远风来处好开襟。\n谁知不离簪缨内，长得逍遥自在心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}